>> title: Shish Tawook, Air Fryer
>> category: Smoked & Grilled
>> tags: chicken, lebanese, air fryer, basket, yogurt marinade, weeknight
>> counters: The Air Fryer & the Pot
>> dish: shish-tawook
>> kit: Air Fryer
>> aka: air fryer shish tawook, shish taouk, basket chicken skewers, tawook without a grill
>> servings: 4
>> time: 45 min
>> slack: narrow — the tomato paste and yoghurt darken faster than the chicken cooks, so the turn at halfway is the whole difference
>> washing-up: the marinating bowl, the basket

>> step: Written for a preheated 5.7 L basket. From cold add three minutes. Skewers dropped — the pieces sit on the basket.
Over charcoal it is turned every three minutes. Here it is turned once.

>> step: marinate 20 min in the bowl
Marinate @boneless chicken thighs{1 1/4%lb}(570 g; in 1 1/2-in pieces) in a #bowl{} with @whole-milk yogurt{1/3%cup}(80 g), @lemon juice{2%Tbs}, @garlic{4%cloves}(crushed to a paste), @tomato paste{2%tsp}, @olive oil{1%Tbs}, @sweet paprika{1%tsp}, @ground cinnamon{1/4%tsp}, @kosher salt{1 1/2%tsp} for ~marinate{20%min}.

>> step: roast in the basket 200°C (400°F), 12–14 min, one layer
Roast @&(~1)marinated chicken{} in a preheated #air fryer basket{} at 200°C (400°F) for ~air fry{13%min}, one layer and not touching.

>> step: turn at seven minutes — edges caught brown, 74°C inside
Turn @&(~1)tawook{} once.

>> step: scatter the parsley, lemon at the table
Scatter @parsley{2%Tbs}(chopped) over @&(~1)tawook{} with @lemon{1%wedge}.
